# Only rules Astro's own `redirects` config cannot express belong here -
# Cloudflare Pages silently drops everything past the first 100 rules in this
# file. Path-to-path redirects live in src/redirects.mjs instead; see the
# comment at the top of that file.
#
# The /functions/ namespace has to be redirected from *here* rather than with
# Astro redirect pages, because Cloudflare Pages reserves a top-level
# `functions` directory for Pages Functions and excludes it from static assets
# entirely - a redirect stub built at that path would 404 like everything else
# under it. Redirect rules still fire for those paths, which is why this works.
# Two dynamic rules, well inside Cloudflare's limit, forwarding the whole dead
# namespace into /reference/functions/ where the fine-grained legacy mappings
# in src/redirects.mjs can take over.
/functions /reference/functions 301
/functions/* /reference/functions/:splat 301

# Cross-hostname wildcard from the retired docs domain:
docs.textadventures.co.uk/quest/* https://questviva.com/:splat 301
